# === Added 2026-08-04: gex-archive daily CBOE snapshots — public-repo bloat, not needed
# tracked (data-hygiene sweep) ===
# backtest/tools/cboe_oi_bank.py writes journal/gex-archive/{date}-cboe.json every trading
# day (~12-13MB each, full SPY+SPX option chain). 29 had accrued (~365MB) with only the
# first 5 dated ones + known-gaps.json ever committed -- committing the rest (and every
# future day forever) would be permanent, un-rewritable bloat in this PUBLIC repo.
# Verified before ignoring (don't guess): every consumer --
# backtest/tools/gex_archive_health.py#parse_archive_dates, setup/scripts/engine_health.py
# #check_gex_archive, backtest/autoresearch/_b4_gamma_wall_interaction.py#_gex_archive_days,
# and automation's Gamma_CboeOiBank scheduler itself -- reads the archive DIRECTORY LISTING
# straight off disk (Path.iterdir()/glob()); none of them read git history or care whether
# a file is tracked. gitignoring does not delete anything or touch the 7 already-tracked
# legacy files (2026-06-19.json, 2026-06-22..26-cboe.json, known-gaps.json stay tracked --
# .gitignore never untracks a file already in the index). known-gaps.json's KNOWN_GAP
# registry (2026-08-01, commit 731aae42) already exists precisely to let the continuity
# checker tolerate an EXPLAINED absence gracefully -- confirming this archive's consumers
# are designed around "some days may be missing," which is the same shape as "some days
# aren't git-tracked" from every consumer's point of view (both just mean the file isn't on
# disk / isn't read; neither is a correctness regression on this machine). Going forward,
# new daily snapshots stay on disk (fully readable by every consumer above) but out of git.
journal/gex-archive/*-cboe.json

# Live TradingView chart-drawing state (entity_ids of the lines Gamma itself drew).
# Untracked on purpose (C34): a tree-wide git op restoring stale entity_ids would
# orphan the current lines. The "[G] " TAG sweep in draw_key_levels.py is the
# recovery path, so this file is disposable by design.
automation/state/chart-autodraw.json

# --- Obsidian vault (2026-08-09) -------------------------------------------
# The repo root IS an Obsidian vault (.obsidian created 2026-07-09). This repo is
# PUBLIC, so the personal/vendored parts of the vault must never be pushed:
#   workspace.json          -> personal pane layout + hardcoded local paths
#   plugins/*/main.js|.css  -> 4.4MB of vendored third-party JS (realclaudian)
#   plugins/*/data.json     -> plugin state incl. Claude conversation IDs
# The reproducible config (which core/community plugins are on, app + appearance
# settings, and any .base views we author) IS tracked so the vault rebuilds anywhere.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/plugins/*/main.js
.obsidian/plugins/*/styles.css
.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json
.obsidian/graph.json
